	quest.06397541643EE9E4.quest_desc: [
		"Endgame blocks restricted, 4 durability."
		"Will not work on Chaos Block, Ultimate Block, Infinity Block, Infinity Crux, Ultimate Crux, Klein Star Crux, HDPE Block, Plutonium Block, Polonium Block, or Anitmatter Block."
		""
		"Right-click a block with a wand → it becomes an Enlivened Block entity."
		""
		"Enlivened entities can be captured/duplicated by other mods , providing a renewable source of that block. Note: Does not work if the spawner does not copy NBT."
