		"You can link drawers to it without having direct contact (Range can be extended with upgrades)."
		""
		"To link a drawer to a drawer controller you need to use a Linking Tool."
	]
	quest.0BC9DE119AF74A7A.quest_desc: ["§6Fluix ME Glass Cable§r is the simplest cable to make, transfers power and up to 8 channels. It comes in 17 different colors, the default being Fluix, and can be dyed any color using any of the 16 dyes."]
	quest.0BCC8E0A991A6D2F.quest_desc: ["Craft a §6Dank Blueprint§r to copy one Dank's lock and filter settings onto another, keeping every Dank in your setup behaving the same."]
