	quest.0C6F86ABF8F070B8.title: "Ender Library"
	quest.0C71AB75B63CC9A4.quest_desc: ["It does not use durability. Right-clicking a Dirt block with the §6Hoe of the Green Earth§r will place a 9x9 square of Farmland centered on the clicked block. "]
	quest.0C80CE674E69189A.title: "Masher Upgrades"
	quest.0C996810BEF9338E.quest_desc: ["§6Green Fuel§r. Dense EMC fuel refined from matter, feeding the upper machine tiers."]
	quest.0C996810BEF9338E.quest_subtitle: "Project Expansion: Fuel"
	quest.0C996810BEF9338E.title: "Green Fuel"
	quest.0CA6B94A84718B7D.quest_desc: [
		"Your starting point for Project E."
		""
		"Through crafting with the Philosopher's Stone (press C), you have discovered that the intense heat created when crafting can allow you to smelt 7 dusts or ores with a catalyst (namely charcoal or coal)."
		""
		"The Philosopher's Stone will also allow you to transmute dirt into sand and sand into grass. Stone can become cobblestone and likewise. Charging it (press V to charge, shift-V to discharge) will affect a wider area."
		""
		"Used to craft a variety of alchemical items and materials, the Philosopher's Stone is not consumed in the process."
	]
	quest.0CAF7DA28CEC7A44.quest_desc: ["§6Andesite Alloy§r, the cornerstone material made by mixing Andesite with iron in a Mechanical Mixer or by hand. Almost every early machine needs it."]
	quest.0CAF7DA28CEC7A44.quest_subtitle: "Create"
	quest.0CAFAE72AAEDE844.quest_desc: ["Obtained by reprocessing bluetonium and cyanite."]
