	quest.0DD30F7106D1B084.quest_desc: ["Collect Glassential's specialty panes: §6Glowstone Lamp§r, §6Lava Lamp§r, and §6Redstone§r glass, plus the one-way §6Ethereal§r and §6Dark Ethereal§r glass for hidden rooms and viewing galleries."]
	quest.0DD30F7106D1B084.quest_subtitle: "Glassential"
	quest.0DD30F7106D1B084.title: "Glass Menagerie"
	quest.0DE503DBE65F8EED.quest_desc: ["§6Citrinetine Modifiers§r. Slot these into a Citrinetine Miner to tune it: §eEnergy§r lowers power draw, §eItem§r boosts output, §eSpeed§r runs it faster. Craft all three for tier §e3§r."]
	quest.0DE503DBE65F8EED.quest_subtitle: "Void Miners"
	quest.0DE503DBE65F8EED.title: "Citrinetine Modifiers"
	quest.0E012180FF171EA3.quest_desc: ["Max tier for the pressure tube."]
	quest.0E0DCFDDD225CBE9.quest_desc: ["Surrounding yourself in dark matter seems like such a good idea! It absorbs a large amount of damage taken. You are nearly invincible with the set of armor. At times, you think that you can see movement within the sheen of armor."]
	quest.0E2C104568720EE9.title: "Sinful Runes"
	quest.0E2C52943E79D629.quest_desc: ["Assemble the complete Chipped suite: Botanist Workbench, Alchemy Bench, Carpenter's Table, Loom Table, Mason Table, and Tinkering Table. Every material category, covered."]
