	quest.0E41661C427B45D2.title: "Cosmic Liquifying Factory"
	quest.0E7A8DAC2DBAEB4D.quest_desc: ["Extends your reach to the terminal. 16 blocks distance."]
	quest.0EBFD58D6F06DFE7.quest_desc: ["Each of the tiers adds more storage slots and more upgrade slots."]
	quest.0EC0A9113D7B1D70.quest_desc: ["§6Energite Ingot§r, alloyed from Fluxite and Nickel. Used in batteries and high-tier energy components."]
	quest.0EC0A9113D7B1D70.quest_subtitle: "Oritech"
	quest.0EC5F7CAC60A570B.quest_desc: ["Try not to think about it"]
	quest.0EC9E0D3EA56886C.quest_desc: [
		"Using advanced connectors you can overcome the limitation of regular connectors and access the down side of a furnace from any other side. Advanced connectors have other advantages. They allow higher speeds for item and fluid transfer (10 ticks minimum per operation as opposed to 20) and can store more RF (which means they can also transfer more RF)."
		""
		"One warning: an advanced energy connector can still not extract energy from another side. The reason for this is that it is actually the generator/producer itself that pushes energy and it will not do that through that other side. Insertion of energy to another side does work however."
	]
	quest.0ECF2501E3A2BC77.quest_desc: ["Raises the stack-size limit much further (Tier 3)."]
	quest.0ECF2501E3A2BC77.quest_subtitle: "Sophisticated Storage"
	quest.0ED1D5CE75D09FD6.quest_desc: ["Apotheosis covers gear in random affixes. Craft a Simple Reforging Table, then the full Reforging Table, to reroll the affixes on a piece of equipment."]
	quest.0ED1D5CE75D09FD6.quest_subtitle: "Apotheosis"
	quest.0ED1D5CE75D09FD6.title: "Reforging"
