	quest.0F38E2D00696942B.title: "Elite Sawing Factory"
	quest.0F3971AB139B71F9.quest_desc: ["Craft a §6Storm Eye§r from prismarine, a lightning rod and an Eye of Ender to summon §cScylla§r, the storm of the deep."]
