	quest.13A3B72AB1263377.title: "Maximum Capacity"
	quest.13C7A5F0B1449B50.quest_desc: ["Apothic Enchanting reworks the table around three stats drawn from nearby shelves: ETERNA raises the maximum enchant level, QUANTA controls power and randomness, and ARCANA boosts the odds of rare and treasure enchants. Craft a Hellshelf, which raises your table well past vanilla bookshelves."]
	quest.13C7A5F0B1449B50.quest_subtitle: "Apothic Enchanting"
	quest.13C7A5F0B1449B50.title: "A Better Bookshelf"
