		"Used to infuse items; also used to craft Utherium Crystals."
		""
		"Note: this process can be automated with hoppers, with inputs and outputs similar to a vanilla furnace."
	]
	quest.1577F24F9901E9BA.quest_desc: ["§6Orange Collector§r, tier §e13§r of §e16§r. Collectors generate EMC from light. Each tier stores more and produces faster."]
