	quest.15AF28F4684F51EF.quest_desc: [
		"To obtain netherrack, first make witch water by placing a barrel of water on a mycelium block (created by clicking mycelium spores on a dirt block). Then, combine witch water and lava in a stone barrel to create netherrack."
		""
		"You can also make a netherrack generator using lava and witchwater - just like you would make a cobblestone generator with lava and water!"
	]
	quest.15B720B7F41B48E7.quest_desc: [
		"Right click to instantly mines blocks based on the charge level (V, shift+V)."
		""
		"- disabled"
		"- 3x3x2"
		"- 5x5x3"
		""
		"Does not mine dirt or gravel. It's also a powerful weapon and can be used as a tool to mine a single block at a time."
	]
