	quest.17DF0434ABFC1C8F.quest_desc: ["Forge the three storm weapons from Scylla's essence: Ceraunus, Astrape, and Brontes."]
	quest.17DF0434ABFC1C8F.quest_subtitle: "Cataclysm"
	quest.17DF0434ABFC1C8F.title: "Storm Arsenal"
	quest.17E258709C662348.quest_desc: ["§6Red Matter§r is a component added by ProjectE. As an item with a high EMC value, it is suitable to be used as a template in an Energy Condenser to store EMC. As a crafting component, Red Matter is used in the crafting of high-end machines, tools, armor and accessories."]
	quest.17E4461E660A5146.quest_desc: ["§6Basic Crushing Factory§r. Processes many items at once. Higher tiers add more slots and speed."]
