	quest.1830BED4361BCD12.quest_desc: ["§6Ironwood Ingot§r is an item that can be obtained from smelting Raw Ironwood."]
	quest.18353B88A8A3CB0B.quest_desc: ["Injectors must be correct tier for crafting, see JEI. Power is required for fusion crafting. Injectors are upgradable to next tier."]
