	quest.253B925F5877067D.quest_desc: ["Sift gravel using a sieve and mesh to get ore chunks."]
	quest.253C30F7A01EEDC4.quest_desc: ["Salvage gear until you hold one Affix Material of every rarity: §fCommon§r, §aUncommon§r, §bRare§r, §5Epic§r and §6Mythic§r."]
