	quest.27A4FEB8FF983107.quest_subtitle: "Botania"
	quest.27A8BB58004C1DB9.quest_desc: ["Any item placed into its inventory will be converted into EMC. It transfers energy from Energy Collectors to Energy Condensers. When transferring, it gives a 3 EMC per second bonus. It is also used to charge the Klein Star series with EMC. "]
	quest.27C6500602C43B1E.quest_desc: ["Inscriber press for §bConcurrent Circuits§r. Use it in an Inscriber or Circuit Slicer to stamp the prints."]
	quest.27C6500602C43B1E.quest_subtitle: "ExtendedAE"
	quest.27C9EAA07B64CDD3.quest_desc: [
		"The import bus pulls items and fluids (and whatever else, given addons) from the inventory it's touching and pushes them into network storage."
		""
		"For purposes of lag reduction, if the import bus has not imported something recently, it goes into a sort of \"sleep mode\" where it operates slowly, and wakes up and accelerates to full speed (4 operations per second) when it successfully imports something."
		""
		"They are cable subparts."
	]
	quest.27D559AF2FF8AB16.quest_desc: ["Open one stack of chance cubes (any before this does not count)."]
	quest.283192E3B8DBB818.quest_desc: ["Add an §6Oven§r to cook and bake, and a §6Sink§r for an endless water source. On a floating island, the Sink alone is a lifesaver."]
	quest.283192E3B8DBB818.quest_subtitle: "Cooking for Blockheads"
	quest.283192E3B8DBB818.title: "Cook It Up"
	quest.284AD374B7EC81DF.quest_desc: ["Even with the dark matter armor, you can still take a noticeable amount of damage when things start getting hairy. You decide to try throwing some red matter at the problem like any good alchemist, and find that this new Red Matter Armor blocks so much incoming damage you can't even feel anything apart from the actual kinetic energy pushing you around. But... Maybe you can go even one step further?"]
	quest.287A51D0AE8AF938.quest_desc: ["§6Advanced Induction Provider§r. Raises an Induction Matrix's transfer rate."]
	quest.287A51D0AE8AF938.quest_subtitle: "Extras: Storage"
	quest.287A51D0AE8AF938.title: "Advanced Induction Provider"
	quest.28826218E3F096EC.quest_desc: ["Claim the §6Infernal Forge§r, a flaming greatsword."]
