		"Items made in the Engineer's workbench are generally used in other crafting recipes. A good example is the powered lantern, which blocks hostile mobs from spawning in a radius! "
		""
		"4Note: There is a bug that will sometimes result in a game crash when adding or removing blueprints to the workbench. It has been reported to the mod dev.r"
	]
