	quest.3199091CA87F1CD1.quest_desc: ["Extreme Reactors is a continuation of the classic mod Big Reactors. Reactors and Turbines are multi-block structures that have the potential to generate large amounts of power. This book will guide you through the process."]
	quest.3199091CA87F1CD1.quest_subtitle: "Extreme Reactors"
	quest.31A42D4E46C5856B.quest_desc: [
		"To use framed blocks:"
		""
		"- Right click the block with almost any solid block to make it look alike."
		"- Right click the block with a fluid container to make it look like the fluid in the container."
		"- Right click the block with Glowstone Dust to make it produce light."
		"- Right click the block with a Framed Hammer to remove the camo."
		"- Right click the block with an empty fluid container to remove a fluid camo."
	]
	quest.31AABC96FBE7CAA1.quest_desc: ["The §6Basic Machine Core§r, gated by Lapis and Copper. Required for every basic processing machine."]
