	quest.36751E0CBED417FA.quest_desc: ["Storage Components are the core of all AE2 cells, determining the capacity of the cells. Each tier increases the capacity by 4x and costs 3 of the previous tier."]
	quest.3675B13A3A6344C7.quest_desc: ["Place a §6Dank Dock§r to slot a Dank into the world. Pipes and hoppers can then pull from and push into it, automating your portable storage. Here's a second dock to build a network."]
