	quest.3D41E84C0D2DDDE4.quest_subtitle: "MekaSuit \\& Meka-Tool"
	quest.3D41E84C0D2DDDE4.title: "Frost Walker Module"
	quest.3D687AB5F80496E7.quest_desc: ["§6Basic Fluid Tank§r. Portable fluid storage."]
	quest.3D687AB5F80496E7.quest_subtitle: "Extras: Storage"
	quest.3D687AB5F80496E7.title: "Basic Fluid Tank"
	quest.3D70E1BB2986C4DB.quest_desc: [
		"The fundamental unit of this mod is the Data Model - an item which holds information about an entity that you can utilize to generate their drops. To get a Data Model, you must first craft a Data Model Framework, and use it on the target entity to build the model. Once you have your model, you will have to train it."
		""
		"Training a Data Model can be done in one of two ways, with a Deep Learner or with a Simulation Chamber. The deep learner allows you to store a few data models within, and kills you receive will begin to train the model. All models start out in the Faulty state, and must be trained up to Basic in the deep learner."
	]
	quest.3D7235F076947147.quest_desc: ["Craft a §6Flame Eye§r from blaze powder, soul sand and netherite scrap to summon §cIgnis§r, the burning knight."]
	quest.3D7235F076947147.quest_subtitle: "Cataclysm"
	quest.3D7235F076947147.title: "Flame Eye"
	quest.3D7B9D339F5F667B.quest_desc: ["Craft a §6Monstrous Eye§r from blackstone, netherite scrap and lava to summon the §cNetherite Monstrosity§r."]
	quest.3D7B9D339F5F667B.quest_subtitle: "Cataclysm"
	quest.3D7B9D339F5F667B.title: "Monstrous Eye"
	quest.3D85F5460E7FB63F.quest_desc: ["§6Steel Ingot§r, alloyed from Iron and Coal Dust in the Powered Furnace. The backbone metal for advanced machinery."]
	quest.3D85F5460E7FB63F.quest_subtitle: "Oritech"
	quest.3D8BFC568A459C6E.quest_desc: ["§6Lime Relay§r, tier §e11§r of §e16§r. Relays move EMC between blocks and add a bonus per second. Higher tiers transfer far more."]
	quest.3D8BFC568A459C6E.quest_subtitle: "Project Expansion: Relays"
	quest.3D8BFC568A459C6E.title: "Lime Relay [MK 11]"
	quest.3DAA865F15382848.quest_desc: ["Created using the latex processing unit. Smelt to make plastic."]
	quest.3DADB25EBDA4BF03.quest_desc: ["§6Elite Smelting Factory§r. Processes many items at once. Higher tiers add more slots and speed."]
	quest.3DADB25EBDA4BF03.quest_subtitle: "Extras: Factories"
	quest.3DADB25EBDA4BF03.title: "Elite Smelting Factory"
	quest.3DAE18F04A718CBE.quest_desc: ["§6Elite Induction Cell§r. Raises an Induction Matrix's energy capacity."]
	quest.3DAE18F04A718CBE.quest_subtitle: "Extras: Storage"
	quest.3DAE18F04A718CBE.title: "Elite Induction Cell"
	quest.3DB50DD3D894E3E5.quest_desc: ["§6Infinite Chemical Tank§r. Stores gases, slurries and other chemicals."]
	quest.3DB50DD3D894E3E5.quest_subtitle: "Extras: Storage"
	quest.3DB50DD3D894E3E5.title: "Infinite Chemical Tank"
	quest.3DC50D49076BCE01.quest_desc: ["§6Verdium Modifiers§r. Slot these into a Verdium Miner to tune it: §eEnergy§r lowers power draw, §eItem§r boosts output, §eSpeed§r runs it faster. Craft all three for tier §e4§r."]
	quest.3DC50D49076BCE01.quest_subtitle: "Void Miners"
	quest.3DC50D49076BCE01.title: "Verdium Modifiers"
	quest.3DCF2760970747FA.quest_desc: ["Forge §6The Incinerator§r, the Monstrosity's signature hammer."]
	quest.3DCF2760970747FA.quest_subtitle: "Cataclysm"
	quest.3DCF2760970747FA.title: "The Incinerator"
	quest.3DE14C0429B4EEF4.quest_desc: ["§6Blue Power Flower§r, tier §e8§r of §e16§r. A Power Flower is a self-contained collector, relay and condenser in one block, generating EMC on its own."]
	quest.3DE14C0429B4EEF4.quest_subtitle: "Project Expansion: Power Flowers"
	quest.3DE14C0429B4EEF4.title: "Blue Power Flower [MK 8]"
	quest.3DEE519E4BFF0D8A.quest_desc: ["Place a §6Dank Dock§r to slot a Dank into the world. Pipes and hoppers can then pull from and push into it, automating your portable storage. Here's a second dock to build a network."]
	quest.3DEE519E4BFF0D8A.quest_subtitle: "Dank Storage"
	quest.3DEE519E4BFF0D8A.title: "Docking Station"
	quest.3E01ACF28AD5D0DB.quest_desc: ["§6§lThe Final Star§r. The pinnacle of Project Expansion and the ultimate EMC artifact. You have conquered every collector, relay, flower, link and star."]
	quest.3E01ACF28AD5D0DB.quest_subtitle: "Project Expansion: Capstone"
	quest.3E01ACF28AD5D0DB.title: "The Final Star"
	quest.3E0C3A64AC5CD7AC.quest_desc: [
		"To use framed blocks:"
		""
		"- Right click the block with almost any solid block to make it look alike."
		"- Right click the block with a fluid container to make it look like the fluid in the container."
		"- Right click the block with Glowstone Dust to make it produce light."
		"- Right click the block with a Framed Hammer to remove the camo."
		"- Right click the block with an empty fluid container to remove a fluid camo."
	]
	quest.3E0C71387121A24E.quest_desc: ["§6Conjure Island: Starter§r. Run on the Ritual Brazier to raise a fresh floating island, ideal for expanding a skyblock."]
	quest.3E0C71387121A24E.quest_subtitle: "Ars Caelum"
	quest.3E14B10C0D95CDF9.quest_desc: [
		"If you really need animal seeds before you can craft the base, then you can purchase it here. It doesn't come cheap! "
		""
		"Repeatable every 30 minutes."
	]
	quest.3E14B10C0D95CDF9.quest_subtitle: "Get a bad spawn biome?"
	quest.3E14B10C0D95CDF9.title: "Need Animals?"
	quest.3E4218A3CBD9CB28.quest_desc: ["Crafted from resources you will find in the Otherside."]
	quest.3E46241002680BCC.quest_desc: [
		"Interfaces act like a small chest and fluid tank that fills itself from and empties to network storage depending on what you set it to keep a stock of in its slots. It tries to complete this in a single gametick, so it can fill itself with or empty itself from up to 9 stacks per gametick, making it a fast method of import or export if you have fast item pipes."
		""
		"Another useful trait is that while most fluid tanks can only store 1 type of fluid, interfaces can store up to 9, as well as items. They're essentially just chests/multi-fluid tanks with some extra functionality, and you can prevent that extra functionality by keeping them disconnected from any networks. Thus, they are useful in some niche cases where you want to store a small amount of a bunch of different stuff."
	]
	quest.3E51E9D3550062D8.quest_desc: ["Teleport anywhere by spending EMC per block traveled."]
	quest.3E51E9D3550062D8.quest_subtitle: "Project Expansion: EMC Utility"
	quest.3E51E9D3550062D8.title: "Alchemical Book"
	quest.3E64496AD2877DE4.quest_desc: ["Refine §e512§r Gold Ingots for the work ahead."]
	quest.3E64496AD2877DE4.quest_subtitle: "Apprentice"
	quest.3E64496AD2877DE4.title: "Going for Gold"
	quest.3E745AF0ACA85BA6.quest_desc: ["Injectors must be correct tier for crafting, see JEI. Power is required for fusion crafting. Injectors are upgradable to next tier."]
	quest.3E7A1B46933CB6FB.quest_desc: ["The §6Sacrificial Altar§r from Ars Ocultas, used to craft the mod's dark and stealth themed glyphs."]
	quest.3E7A1B46933CB6FB.quest_subtitle: "Ars Ocultas"
	quest.3E7EFAE0131CDB93.quest_desc: ["A bone is an item primarily obtained from skeletons and similar mobs. It can be crafted into bone meal or used to tame wild wolves. "]
	quest.3EA141C7DA9CD3E8.quest_desc: ["Craft an §6Endshelf§r. Endshelves carry a max-§bEterna§r cap of §e90§r, the doorway to top-tier enchants."]
	quest.3EA141C7DA9CD3E8.quest_subtitle: "Apothic Enchanting"
	quest.3EA141C7DA9CD3E8.title: "To the End"
	quest.3EB30F879AB9402A.quest_desc: ["Use as a fertilizer in advanced planters!"]
	quest.3EC6F34F365E3878.quest_desc: ["§6Magnum Star Zwei§r. A portable EMC battery, far beyond a Klein Star Omega. Capacity climbs with each size from §eEin§r to §eOmega§r."]
	quest.3EC6F34F365E3878.quest_subtitle: "Project Expansion: Greater Stars"
	quest.3EC6F34F365E3878.title: "Magnum Star Zwei"
	quest.3EC6F6C5228BAD28.quest_desc: ["Combines the functions of a pickaxe, shovel, and sword with immense mining speed and attack power"]
	quest.3ED71A33E1C08473.quest_desc: ["Obtain a Gem and a Sigil of Socketing. The sigil adds a socket to a piece of gear. Slot the gem in for a permanent bonus."]
	quest.3ED71A33E1C08473.quest_subtitle: "Apotheosis"
	quest.3ED71A33E1C08473.title: "Gems  Sockets"
	quest.3ED9992DD5070D51.quest_desc: ["Using a simple cooking system and a few familiar ingredients, Farmer's Delight lets you be able to prepare a wide variety of hearty meals: from sandwiches to salads and stews, from beautiful desserts to mouth-watering feasts, no ingredient will be left behind in your kitchen!"]
	quest.3ED9992DD5070D51.quest_subtitle: "Farmer's Delight"
	quest.3EDA781E026296F3.quest_desc: ["This machine uses energy to extract dusts out of certain blocks and ores, making it essential to producing different kinds of tools. Not to be mistaken with the Crusher, this machine is the pulverizer equivalent in other mods."]
	quest.3EF82BFE97024F03.quest_desc: ["The §6Advanced Target Designator§r adds chunk wide and multi target functions for the Enderic Laser and Drones."]
	quest.3EF82BFE97024F03.quest_subtitle: "Oritech Things"
	quest.3EFC5E4DCC32D80B.quest_desc: ["Reprocessed fissile fragments, the fuel your reactor consumes."]
	quest.3EFC5E4DCC32D80B.quest_subtitle: "Reactors"
	quest.3EFC5E4DCC32D80B.title: "Fissile Fuel"
	quest.3F0B04F35FFC99B6.quest_desc: ["Dropped when you break an Entro bud before it fully grows. 8 shards craft back into an §dEntro Crystal§r."]
	quest.3F0B04F35FFC99B6.quest_subtitle: "ExtendedAE"
	quest.3F171C175D462267.quest_desc: [
		"Sieve: Auto-sieve materials! Uses the same mesh as regular sieves. Meshes can be enchanted with fortune and efficiency. Need more iron? Try sifting crushed deepslate. Requires power (RF)."
		""
		"Hammer: Can turn cobble to gravel, gravel to sand, sand to dust, and more! Requires a hammer (which can be enchanted with efficiency). Requires power (RF)."
	]
	quest.3F171C175D462267.title: "Mechanical Upgrades"
	quest.3F1E49F84A0BA465.quest_desc: ["Crafting Ingredient. Armor made from this material pacifies phantoms."]
	quest.3F208ECDB556335A.quest_desc: ["§6§lRosarium Miner§r, tier §e8§r, the final and fastest Void Miner. With full modifiers it floods your storage with resources from nothing."]
	quest.3F208ECDB556335A.quest_subtitle: "Void Miners"
	quest.3F208ECDB556335A.title: "Rosarium Miner"
	quest.3F374B0073688579.quest_desc: ["Deal with the explosive problem. Defeat §e256§r creepers."]
	quest.3F374B0073688579.quest_subtitle: "Apprentice"
	quest.3F374B0073688579.title: "Hiss No More"
	quest.3F3DC4BF5C52FE28.quest_desc: ["Build a max sized big reactor with reinforced materials."]
	quest.3F41F55338B45804.quest_desc: ["A §6Farmer§r puts a captured villager to work tending a crop and harvesting it for you on a loop."]
	quest.3F41F55338B45804.quest_subtitle: "Easy Villagers"
	quest.3F41F55338B45804.title: "Farmer"
	quest.3F685D4C6FD56091.quest_desc: ["A MekaSuit/Meka-Tool module installed at the Modification Station."]
	quest.3F685D4C6FD56091.quest_subtitle: "MekaSuit \\& Meka-Tool"
	quest.3F685D4C6FD56091.title: "Shearing Module"
	quest.3F74784097718DB8.quest_desc: [
		"A peaceful alternative for resource gathering."
		""
		"- A superflat world with a large layer of Stone, then Deepslate, then Netherrack and then End Stone with ores in each layer. but with no caves or caverns."
		"- Completely free of hostile mobs."
		"- Always daytime."
	]
	quest.3F7C17E60A335E1B.quest_desc: ["Refined Glowstone tier shield from Mekanism Tools."]
	quest.3F7C17E60A335E1B.quest_subtitle: "Mekanism Tools"
	quest.3F7C17E60A335E1B.title: "Refined Glowstone Shield"
	quest.3F8BD6F64BECC35C.quest_desc: ["Pump in latex to start making rubber."]
	quest.3F8D587A704CE81C.quest_desc: ["Refer to the Book of Natural Aura (guidebook) for full detailed information on Nature's Aura."]
	quest.3F8D587A704CE81C.title: "Magical Medallions"
	quest.3F9634C76705A187.quest_desc: ["Faster movement, slow falling, and immunity to fall damage. Fly without spending EMC like [Ring of Arcana] (double space). Short flight boosts (hold space). Step assist to scale elevation without jumping (X)."]
	quest.3FB7B9130426EBD8.quest_desc: ["A MekaSuit/Meka-Tool module installed at the Modification Station."]
	quest.3FB7B9130426EBD8.quest_subtitle: "MekaSuit \\& Meka-Tool"
	quest.3FB7B9130426EBD8.title: "Laser Dissipation Module"
	quest.3FBC14ADA3E118E2.quest_desc: [
		"Place the Ender Crafter in-world and right-click to view the GUI. Inside there's a 3x3 crafting grid, similar to a Crafting Table. Place your recipe ingredients into the grid and the Ender Crafter should begin to craft."
		""
		"To increase crafting speed, place Ender Alternators around the Ender Crafter. Any Alternators placed within a 4 block radius will increase the crafting speed. You can tell they are working if they are emitting particle effects."
	]
	quest.3FBC14ADA3E118E2.quest_subtitle: "Extended Crafting"
	quest.3FBCBB7370C13585.quest_desc: ["Craft a §6Salvaging Table§r to break affixed gear back into §9Affix Materials§r by rarity."]
	quest.3FBCBB7370C13585.quest_subtitle: "Apotheosis"
	quest.3FBCBB7370C13585.title: "Salvaging"
	quest.3FE0809FC18DD36F.quest_desc: ["A sword with 8 attack damage."]
	quest.3FF5EFB1D1BBE7D3.quest_desc: ["§6Elite Compressing Factory§r. Processes many items at once. Higher tiers add more slots and speed."]
	quest.3FF5EFB1D1BBE7D3.quest_subtitle: "Extras: Factories"
	quest.3FF5EFB1D1BBE7D3.title: "Elite Compressing Factory"
	quest.3FFD5071CAB35FE9.quest_desc: ["A skyblock classic. Just like a regular bucket, but can only be used in some crafting recipes. Holding lava in it can limit its lifespan."]
	quest.40051E467AB4A36E.quest_desc: ["The foundation of ExtendedAE. Crafted from §dEntro§r materials. Most of its block machines are built on these frames."]
	quest.40051E467AB4A36E.quest_subtitle: "ExtendedAE"
	quest.400B3C383231B9BE.quest_desc: ["The §6Meka-Tool§r replaces every tool at once and grows with modules."]
	quest.400B3C383231B9BE.quest_subtitle: "MekaSuit \\& Meka-Tool"
	quest.400B3C383231B9BE.title: "Meka-Tool"
	quest.402ABC0A6EA35DD4.quest_desc: ["You use connectors to connect machines to your network. Through that connector various channels (even with different types) can do their thing. Normal connectors only allow access through the side from which you are placing the connector. I.e. For a vanilla furnace that would mean that with a normal connector you can only get the melted result by placing a connector at the bottom of the furnace. "]
	quest.402C2DF5EB7E3496.quest_desc: [
		"It uses no durability and kills every mob or player with one hit, even if the player is in Creative mode."
		""
		"Yes, this even works on the Chaos Guardian."
	]
	quest.402D82ABE31FC142.quest_desc: ["Used to combine circuit boards with etching acid, creating unassembled Printed Circuit Boards (PCBs)"]
	quest.402E44B728DB4434.quest_desc: ["§6Cyan Relay§r, tier §e9§r of §e16§r. Relays move EMC between blocks and add a bonus per second. Higher tiers transfer far more."]
	quest.402E44B728DB4434.quest_subtitle: "Project Expansion: Relays"
	quest.402E44B728DB4434.title: "Cyan Relay [MK 9]"
	quest.4052BC600A11FEB8.quest_subtitle: "QIO Network"
	quest.4052BC600A11FEB8.title: "QIO Drive Array"
	quest.40639087E44ED689.quest_desc: ["§6Gargantuan Star Vier§r. A portable EMC battery, the largest EMC storage in the game. Capacity climbs with each size from §eEin§r to §eOmega§r."]
	quest.40639087E44ED689.quest_subtitle: "Project Expansion: Greater Stars"
	quest.40639087E44ED689.title: "Gargantuan Star Vier"
	quest.40835DA2F48D756E.quest_desc: ["§6White Power Flower§r, tier §e14§r of §e16§r. A Power Flower is a self-contained collector, relay and condenser in one block, generating EMC on its own."]
	quest.40835DA2F48D756E.quest_subtitle: "Project Expansion: Power Flowers"
	quest.40835DA2F48D756E.title: "White Power Flower [MK 14]"
	quest.4086DD3CD2A1CE99.quest_desc: ["Craft a §6Storm Eye§r from prismarine, a lightning rod and an Eye of Ender to summon §cScylla§r, the storm of the deep."]
	quest.4086DD3CD2A1CE99.quest_subtitle: "Cataclysm"
	quest.4086DD3CD2A1CE99.title: "Storm Eye"
	quest.409BF70E8D188CD9.quest_desc: ["Control circuits are used to craft several Mekanism items and machines. Tier 5."]
	quest.409BF70E8D188CD9.quest_subtitle: "Mekanism Extras"
	quest.40A0F17B2D586DFD.quest_desc: ["§6Advanced Mechanical Pipe§r. Carries fluids between machines."]
	quest.40A0F17B2D586DFD.quest_subtitle: "Extras: Transport"
	quest.40A0F17B2D586DFD.title: "Advanced Mechanical Pipe"
	quest.40B2030CD2B574B0.quest_desc: ["§e50%§r cheaper EMC teleportation."]
	quest.40B2030CD2B574B0.quest_subtitle: "Project Expansion: EMC Utility"
	quest.40B2030CD2B574B0.title: "Advanced Alchemical Book"
	quest.40B6870514C5217B.quest_desc: ["Plant on grass to grow a chicken. Make sure to give it plenty of breathing room to grow."]
	quest.40BA19D0B80C6F0A.quest_desc: ["Surrounding yourself in dark matter seems like such a good idea! It absorbs a large amount of damage taken. You are nearly invincible with the set of armor. At times, you think that you can see movement within the sheen of armor."]
	quest.40F3CC129DFC5BCE.quest_desc: ["Hold shift key when hovering over the item to see stats."]
	quest.410105599B92D2A8.quest_desc: ["A QIO storage drive. Higher tiers hold far more item types and counts."]
	quest.410105599B92D2A8.quest_subtitle: "QIO Network"
	quest.410105599B92D2A8.title: "Black Hole Drive"
	quest.41110F97CD2CC596.quest_desc: ["§6Ultimate Combining Factory§r. Processes many items at once. Higher tiers add more slots and speed."]
	quest.41110F97CD2CC596.quest_subtitle: "Extras: Factories"
	quest.41110F97CD2CC596.title: "Ultimate Combining Factory"
	quest.41174CEBEE63B6EA.quest_desc: ["Hold shift key when hovering over the items to see stats."]
	quest.41174CEBEE63B6EA.title: "Mk1"
	quest.4120B418636419F8.quest_desc: ["§6Focus of Fire§r. While held or in a Bangle it adds fire damage and burning to your damage spells."]
	quest.4120B418636419F8.quest_subtitle: "Ars Elemental"
	quest.41272A7A1AB12284.quest_desc: ["The §6Gearshift§r reverses rotation when given a redstone signal. Essential for any pistons, bearings, or moving contraptions."]
	quest.41272A7A1AB12284.quest_subtitle: "Create"
	quest.414D5BBD655805DD.quest_desc: ["The Remnant's reach weapon, a long-range thrusting spear."]
	quest.414D5BBD655805DD.quest_subtitle: "Cataclysm"
	quest.414D5BBD655805DD.title: "Ancient Spear"
	quest.41544159462CF7B3.quest_desc: ["A MekaSuit/Meka-Tool module installed at the Modification Station."]
