	quest.5183D0521334BA27.title: "Fission Reactor Port"
	quest.518837817CC3B489.quest_desc: ["Made up of 9 cobblestone!"]
	quest.51938F2731D46972.quest_desc: [
		"Smelt coal to create graphite."
		""
		"Extreme Reactors utilizes multiblock machines quite heavilly. A multiblock machine is composed by many different blocks that you will place in the world next to each other. Continue through this questline and refer to the mod's book for help!"
	]
	quest.51A05CB5261270C4.quest_desc: ["§6Supreme Lathing Factory§r. An Extras-only factory type, available in the four highest tiers."]
	quest.51A05CB5261270C4.quest_subtitle: "Extras: Factories"
	quest.51A05CB5261270C4.title: "Supreme Lathing Factory"
	quest.51AC0E98DDB51802.quest_desc: ["The §6Building Gadget§r allows you to build structures using a set of different Building Modes."]
	quest.51B17D757A288506.quest_desc: ["Compress matter into a storage block for compact stockpiles."]
	quest.51B17D757A288506.quest_subtitle: "Project Expansion: Matter"
	quest.51B17D757A288506.title: "Matter Block"
	quest.51B3BFB20B56F955.quest_desc: ["§6Purple Matter§r, matter tier §e6§r. The crafting material behind tier §e6§r collectors, relays, flowers and links."]
	quest.51B3BFB20B56F955.quest_subtitle: "Project Expansion: Matter"
	quest.51B3BFB20B56F955.title: "Purple Matter"
	quest.51B757FA4DB37E84.quest_desc: ["The §6Hand Crank§r generates a brief burst of rotation when you right-click it. The earliest manual power source."]
	quest.51B757FA4DB37E84.quest_subtitle: "Create"
	quest.51C46499FC3F2F03.quest_desc: ["Craft a §6Cursed Eye§r from bone, rotten flesh and phantom membrane to summon the §cMaledictus§r."]
	quest.51C46499FC3F2F03.quest_subtitle: "Cataclysm"
	quest.51C46499FC3F2F03.title: "Cursed Eye"
	quest.51C61DE36D90B959.quest_desc: [
		"Place one pattern holder in a Packager, and the other in an Unpackager, both connected to a ME Network. "
		""
		"The Packager will accept items and make them into Recipe Packages and the Unpackager will take them and output items into an adjacent inventory. "
		""
		"Both machines tell the ME Network what it can do according to the pattern holder, and the Packager, when connected, ejects packages into the network"
	]
	quest.51D1C30EA83859DA.quest_desc: ["Breaks blocks or absorbs items by its config filter, with no subnet needed."]
	quest.51D1C30EA83859DA.quest_subtitle: "ExtendedAE"
	quest.51E5D8D9B1D67E8C.quest_desc: [
		"Infused Iron is a material blessed with the powers of aura, allowing it to be used in several magical natural items. Note that the same infusion is possible using the materials' block form."
		""
		"Refer to the Book of Natural Aura (guidebook) for full detailed information on Nature's Aura."
	]
	quest.51FA43329C5128C3.quest_desc: ["Housing that turns a storage component into a portable or ME Source Storage Cell."]
	quest.51FA43329C5128C3.quest_subtitle: "Ars Energistique"
	quest.522B459DA586F112.quest_desc: [
		"This seed base is used to craft different resource seeds."
		""
		"Resource Seeds are the main purpose of Mystical Agriculture. These seeds can grow more than 100 different resources, including Diamonds, Bones, Copper, Redstone and many others. When harvested they all drop their own Resource Essence, as well as having a 10% chance of dropping a Fertilized Essence."
		""
		"There are different tiers of Resource Seeds. The tiers are dependent on how rare the material grown is."
		""
		"These seeds are created using the Infusion Altar with materials, essences and a Seed Base."
		""
		"These crops cannot be grown using Bonemeal or sped up by shifting."
		""
		"They can be grown in the ground, as well as in the Garden Cloche, Planter, or Farmer with the correct soil."
	]
	quest.523EC60C3C451A3A.quest_desc: ["§6Cyan Matter§r, matter tier §e9§r. The crafting material behind tier §e9§r collectors, relays, flowers and links."]
	quest.523EC60C3C451A3A.quest_subtitle: "Project Expansion: Matter"
	quest.523EC60C3C451A3A.title: "Cyan Matter"
	quest.5256AA3BCD7975B1.quest_desc: ["§6Absolute Universal Cable§r. Carries Forge Energy."]
	quest.5256AA3BCD7975B1.quest_subtitle: "Extras: Transport"
	quest.5256AA3BCD7975B1.title: "Absolute Universal Cable"
	quest.5267E7C6F511B44B.quest_desc: ["Casings are both decorative and functional blocks used to craft and build various machines and devices within the mod."]
	quest.526E95BD71FA713C.quest_desc: ["About 35.6 million metric tons"]
	quest.52777DC278AAF630.quest_desc: ["Auto-compacts items into block form (e.g. Ingots into blocks) inside the storage."]
	quest.52777DC278AAF630.quest_subtitle: "Sophisticated Storage"
	quest.52914F9E85778478.quest_desc: ["Used to mix liquids with solids."]
	quest.52914F9E85778478.title: "Reprocessor Components"
	quest.52A668C71DD69D71.quest_desc: ["§6Cosmic Purifying Factory§r. Processes many items at once. Higher tiers add more slots and speed."]
	quest.52A668C71DD69D71.quest_subtitle: "Extras: Factories"
	quest.52A668C71DD69D71.title: "Cosmic Purifying Factory"
	quest.52AB76818BD22CA3.quest_desc: ["Knives act as a modest melee weapon: swings faster than a sword for lesser damage"]
	quest.52B58E5D7BBE7FDA.quest_desc: ["§6Gargantuan Star Sphere§r. A portable EMC battery, the largest EMC storage in the game. Capacity climbs with each size from §eEin§r to §eOmega§r."]
	quest.52B58E5D7BBE7FDA.quest_subtitle: "Project Expansion: Greater Stars"
	quest.52B58E5D7BBE7FDA.title: "Gargantuan Star Sphere"
	quest.52DA34ED57CF502B.quest_desc: ["Beheads skeletons and scorches them black"]
	quest.52EE429D7056B815.quest_desc: [
		"Follow the steps outlined in the book on your journey to become a master alchemist."
		""
		"Theurgy aims to introduce a new take on Alchemy in Minecraft. Deviating from the well-trodden path of the \"4 Elements\" - Air, Water, Fire, Earth - it is inspired by classical Alchemy and works with the elements of Sulfur, Salt and Mercury and their handling through a group of processes known as Spagyrics."
		""
		"First and foremost Theurgy tries to create a balanced alchemy experience - not as overpowered as Equivalent Exchange, yet maybe somewhat more practicable than the legendary Thaumcraft."
	]
	quest.52EE429D7056B815.quest_subtitle: "Theurgy"
	quest.52F37674EAB17868.quest_desc: ["§6Aeternalis Fuel§r is a fuel added by ProjectE. By combining 4 pieces of Mobius Fuel with a Philosopher's Stone, a new fuel is created. Aeternalis Fuel burns four times as long as Mobius Fuel and is able to smelt 512 items."]
	quest.5309DA86AB2B5596.quest_desc: ["Stores the same amount of items, but can hold two different types!"]
	quest.5310F88053FC3FCD.quest_desc: ["Pressed §bquantum alloy§r. The base for quantum armor and ability cards."]
	quest.5310F88053FC3FCD.quest_subtitle: "Advanced AE"
	quest.53117A158D446DFF.quest_desc: ["§6Lime Matter§r, matter tier §e11§r. The crafting material behind tier §e11§r collectors, relays, flowers and links."]
	quest.53117A158D446DFF.quest_subtitle: "Project Expansion: Matter"
	quest.53117A158D446DFF.title: "Lime Matter"
	quest.5332F636657E15EC.quest_desc: ["Catalysts are used in complex crafting recipes. They get harder to craft as they move higher in tiers."]
	quest.5343BFCD43ECE225.quest_desc: ["Control circuits are used to craft several Mekanism items and machines. Tier 2."]
	quest.534D29AB411AB0F5.quest_desc: [
		"To use framed blocks:"
		""
		"- Right click the block with almost any solid block to make it look alike."
		"- Right click the block with a fluid container to make it look like the fluid in the container."
		"- Right click the block with Glowstone Dust to make it produce light."
		"- Right click the block with a Framed Hammer to remove the camo."
		"- Right click the block with an empty fluid container to remove a fluid camo."
	]
	quest.537E84EDD29F486A.quest_desc: ["§6Steeleaf§r is a tool and armor material found in Labyrinth, Hollow Hill, and Dark Tower chests. This material is as powerful as Diamond in a tool or armor, but is less durable than even Iron."]
	quest.5392973FED16D6DF.quest_desc: ["Place a §6Dank Dock§r to slot a Dank into the world. Pipes and hoppers can then pull from and push into it, automating your portable storage. Here's a second dock to build a network."]
	quest.5392973FED16D6DF.quest_subtitle: "Dank Storage"
	quest.5392973FED16D6DF.title: "Docking Station"
	quest.53AA32A4817FF008.quest_desc: ["The titan of the abyss. Summon it with the §6Abyssal Sacrifice§r and slay the unslayable."]
	quest.53AA32A4817FF008.quest_subtitle: "Cataclysm"
	quest.53AA32A4817FF008.title: "The Leviathan"
	quest.53ADBC3ADF1C83C0.quest_desc: ["Made of 10,000 invar ingots"]
	quest.53C589F58BFB0BAF.quest_desc: ["§6Supreme Compressing Factory§r. Processes many items at once. Higher tiers add more slots and speed."]
	quest.53C589F58BFB0BAF.quest_subtitle: "Extras: Factories"
	quest.53C589F58BFB0BAF.title: "Supreme Compressing Factory"
	quest.53DDFA5A9F8E055B.quest_desc: ["Generates Source from potions and experience thrown into it."]
	quest.53DDFA5A9F8E055B.quest_subtitle: "Ars Nouveau"
	quest.53EA498BDFCD9AE3.quest_desc: ["The §6Drone Port§r dispatches drones for long range hauling. Uses an Advanced Computing Engine, Superconductor and Unholy Intelligence."]
	quest.53EA498BDFCD9AE3.quest_subtitle: "Oritech"
	quest.53EC26D2780A52A2.quest_desc: ["Names Variable Cards so you can keep your logic organised."]
	quest.53EC26D2780A52A2.quest_subtitle: "Integrated Dynamics"
	quest.53F53BD4220B295B.quest_desc: [
		"Early game power. Generate power (RF) from coal. Other power generation options are obtainable as you move through the pack."
		""
		"Note: To make compressed iron in the early game, set off an explosion next to some iron ingots (TNT plus redstone signal). They will be converted to compressed iron, with a 20% loss rate on average."
	]
	quest.53F53BD4220B295B.quest_subtitle: "Industrial Foregoing"
	quest.53F5A5A785503096.quest_desc: ["Energy storage item that holds and transfers RF"]
	quest.5415823E72EF2E93.quest_desc: ["§6Advanced Pressurized Tube§r. Carries gases and chemicals."]
	quest.5415823E72EF2E93.quest_subtitle: "Extras: Transport"
	quest.5415823E72EF2E93.title: "Advanced Pressurized Tube"
	quest.541A74DE0144E082.quest_desc: [
		"Ender IO machines that have an upgrade slot require capacitors to function."
		""
		"Depending on their Base Modifier, Capacitors can increase the Speed, Range or Energy Storage of machines."
		""
		"Level: 2"
	]
	quest.542ABA63C5122630.quest_subtitle: "Apothic Enchanting"
	quest.542ABA63C5122630.title: "Crystal Seashelf"
	quest.542F897E747F5612.quest_desc: ["A single-spell casting item. Write a spell onto it at the Scribes Table for a cheap dedicated caster."]
	quest.542F897E747F5612.quest_subtitle: "Ars Nouveau"
	quest.543FAEFE24110294.quest_desc: [
		"This device generates energy for your ME network without the need for fuel. Because of the crystal vibrations this device generates, only one can be used in each network. These vibrations even pass through Quartz Fiber."
		""
		"Generation Rate: 20.0 AE/t"
	]
	quest.54400DF255CE3A0B.quest_desc: ["A self-contained quantum autocrafter. Massive parallel crafting without a CPU cluster."]
	quest.54400DF255CE3A0B.quest_subtitle: "Advanced AE"
	quest.5450D90CA26076F5.quest_desc: ["§6Gargantuan Star Zwei§r. A portable EMC battery, the largest EMC storage in the game. Capacity climbs with each size from §eEin§r to §eOmega§r."]
	quest.5450D90CA26076F5.quest_subtitle: "Project Expansion: Greater Stars"
	quest.5450D90CA26076F5.title: "Gargantuan Star Zwei"
	quest.5476B23B4B60A670.quest_desc: ["Iron Jetpacks is a modern Jetpacks mod that is both feature-rich and easy to use. Jetpacks get better as you craft higher tiers. Coils are an integral part of the jetpack crafting process. See JEI."]
	quest.5478FE88578437EC.quest_desc: ["Uses solar power (sun) to generate RF. Tier 3!"]
	quest.5485AE6A649AC6BC.quest_desc: [
		"A vat for alchemical fermentation, required for transmutation."
		""
		"See The Hermetica for more details on Theurgy."
	]
	quest.548F36AD4A633E9D.quest_desc: ["Storage Components are the core of all AE2 cells, determining the capacity of the cells. Each tier increases the capacity by 4x and costs 3 of the previous tier."]
	quest.5495A4A946E19DAC.quest_desc: ["Made up of 43046721 cobblestone!"]
	quest.54A51DF726928CE0.quest_desc: ["Process §e256§r Refined Obsidian."]
	quest.54A51DF726928CE0.quest_subtitle: "Journeyman"
	quest.54A51DF726928CE0.title: "Tame the Volatile"
	quest.54AC69527FD39EF7.quest_desc: [
		"The Seed Reprocessor is a machine built for converting extra seeds into essences."
		""
		"The Seed Reprocessor requires energy to function. You can either provide energy via any Forge Energy compatible energy transfer, or use the internal solid-fuel based generator."
		""
		"The machine can be upgraded using Machine Upgrades for faster operation and increased internal energy storage."
	]
	quest.54B033D5CF77D965.quest_desc: [
		"Faster than the previous tier!"
		""
		"Place the torch on the ground and right-click to access the GUI."
	]
	quest.54BBFA6BC53CD1B7.quest_desc: ["Use as a fertilizer in advanced planters! Can also be used to create mulch."]
	quest.54C1BF4D600DB9EC.quest_desc: ["Scale your grid and supply §e1 billion§r FE to a Quest Task Screen."]
	quest.54C1BF4D600DB9EC.quest_subtitle: "Master"
	quest.54C1BF4D600DB9EC.title: "Surge"
	quest.54D49D29620140DB.quest_desc: ["Fluid and steam ports for the boiler."]
	quest.54D49D29620140DB.quest_subtitle: "Multiblocks"
	quest.54D49D29620140DB.title: "Boiler Valve"
	quest.55084772B82D1A0B.quest_desc: ["The §6Brass Tunnel§r splits or rounds robin items between multiple belts with configurable distribution modes."]
	quest.55084772B82D1A0B.quest_subtitle: "Create"
	quest.552CCEDED0AE6D5C.quest_desc: ["Uses fuel fluids to create air pressure."]
	quest.555892B16F56A381.quest_desc: ["Craft a Salvaging Table to break affixed gear back down into Affix Materials, sorted by rarity."]
	quest.555892B16F56A381.quest_subtitle: "Apotheosis"
	quest.555892B16F56A381.title: "Salvaging"
	quest.5564E31A353195F0.quest_desc: ["§6Supreme Washing Factory§r. An Extras-only factory type, available in the four highest tiers."]
	quest.5564E31A353195F0.quest_subtitle: "Extras: Factories"
	quest.5564E31A353195F0.title: "Supreme Washing Factory"
	quest.5567D284CB6F01AD.quest_desc: ["You have summoned and slain §cevery horror§r Cataclysm could throw at you. The world is yours."]
	quest.5567D284CB6F01AD.quest_subtitle: "Cataclysm"
	quest.5567D284CB6F01AD.title: "Cataclysm Conqueror"
	quest.557AE0C4DC3F74F6.quest_desc: ["A MekaSuit/Meka-Tool module installed at the Modification Station."]
	quest.557AE0C4DC3F74F6.quest_subtitle: "MekaSuit \\& Meka-Tool"
	quest.557AE0C4DC3F74F6.title: "Geothermal Generator Module"
	quest.5587E29C3AFA70B6.quest_desc: ["Upgrade your way to a Tier §e4§r §6Dank§r. Each tier holds far more per item type, turning a pocketful into a portable warehouse."]
	quest.5587E29C3AFA70B6.quest_subtitle: "Dank Storage"
	quest.5587E29C3AFA70B6.title: "Bigger on the Inside"
	quest.558FE9042159159D.quest_desc: [
		"Crafting units simply fill space in a CPU in order to make it a solid rectangular prism, if you don't have enough of the other components. They are also a base ingredient in the other components."
		""
		"Crafting CPUs manage crafting requests/jobs. They store the intermediate ingredients while crafting jobs with multiple steps are being carried out, and affect how big jobs can be, and to some degree how fast they are completed. See autocrafting for more details."
		""
		"Each crafting CPU handles 1 request or job, so if you want to request both a calculation processor and 256 smooth stone at once, you need 2 CPU multiblocks."
		""
		"They can be set to handle requests from players, automation (export busses and interfaces), or both."
		""
		"Right-clicking one brings up a crafting status UI where you can check the progress on the crafting job the CPU is handling."
	]
	quest.55A12669A448C956.quest_desc: ["The §6Digital Miner§r is the scale mining machine of Mekanism. However, this machine is like no other as it \"magically-teleports\" mined blocks to its inventory."]
	quest.55A68150572EC898.title: "Refinery"
	quest.55A816E8EB2D0E2E.quest_desc: ["Made up of 531441 cobblestone!"]
	quest.55D712DF4FD62578.quest_desc: ["Upgrade your way to a Tier §e4§r §6Dank§r. Each tier holds far more per item type, turning a pocketful into a portable warehouse."]
	quest.55D712DF4FD62578.quest_subtitle: "Dank Storage"
	quest.55D712DF4FD62578.title: "Bigger on the Inside"
	quest.55EC62499FA962EA.quest_desc: ["Equip the §6Personal Shrinking Device§r and toggle it on to shrink yourself. Claim this once you have gone §etiny§r."]
	quest.55EC62499FA962EA.quest_subtitle: "Shrink"
	quest.55EC62499FA962EA.title: "Go Tiny"
	quest.56002C75403F4480.quest_desc: ["Steel tier leggings from Mekanism Tools."]
	quest.56002C75403F4480.quest_subtitle: "Mekanism Tools"
	quest.56002C75403F4480.title: "Steel Leggings"
	quest.560B96E29FB0B9FA.quest_desc: ["§6Advanced Electric Pump§r. Pumps fluids far faster than the basic pump."]
	quest.560B96E29FB0B9FA.quest_subtitle: "Extras: Misc"
	quest.560B96E29FB0B9FA.title: "Advanced Electric Pump"
	quest.562821503FB3426F.quest_desc: ["§6Radiance Alloy§r. A high-tier Extras alloy for advanced circuits."]
	quest.562821503FB3426F.quest_subtitle: "Extras: Misc"
	quest.562821503FB3426F.title: "Radiance Alloy"
	quest.5629109B44D3766A.quest_desc: ["A QIO storage drive. Higher tiers hold far more item types and counts."]
	quest.5629109B44D3766A.quest_subtitle: "QIO Network"
	quest.5629109B44D3766A.title: "Supermassive Drive"
	quest.563EF0C91E88B0D5.quest_desc: ["Plant on grass to grow a pig. Make sure to give it plenty of breathing room to grow."]
	quest.566041739730D509.quest_desc: ["An Iron-tier barrel: more rows and upgrade slots than Copper."]
	quest.566041739730D509.quest_subtitle: "Sophisticated Storage"
	quest.56718D2CB87DF305.quest_desc: [
		"Compressed hammers can hammer compressed blocks!"
		""
		"Break a block with a hammer to crush it. Cobblestone -> Gravel, Gravel -> Sand, Sand -> Dust, Netherrack -> Crushed Netherrack, End Stone -> Crushed End Stone, Cobbled Deepslate -> Crushed Deepslate, Blackstone -> Crushed Blackstone, Crushed Netherrack -> Red Sand. Later, you can automate this process with different machines. For now, vein mining and construction sticks will be your friend. "
		""
		"Try hammering logs to obtain wood chippings - great for compost!"
	]
	quest.5675512404BF2759.quest_desc: ["A three-slotted compacting drawer."]
	quest.56772ECF0B3C75CE.quest_desc: ["Upgraded machine frames are crafted using the Dissolution Chamber. See JEI. Requires pink slime, obtained from the mob slaughter factory."]
	quest.567E3DB67F4F025C.quest_desc: ["Foods give more nutrition after cooking them!"]
	quest.567E3DB67F4F025C.quest_subtitle: "Cooked Foods, Minecraft"
	quest.567E3DB67F4F025C.title: "Cooked Foods"
	quest.567EA6F53C2AB8D2.quest_desc: ["Crafting ingredient, slay a blaze to obtain."]
	quest.56A2E5BCEAC34C1F.quest_desc: ["§6Advanced Purifying Factory§r. Processes many items at once. Higher tiers add more slots and speed."]
	quest.56A2E5BCEAC34C1F.quest_subtitle: "Extras: Factories"
	quest.56A2E5BCEAC34C1F.title: "Advanced Purifying Factory"
	quest.56A609B58D0FA6C0.quest_desc: [
		"Only works on Vanilla blocks, 1 durability."
		""
		"Right-click a block with a wand → it becomes an Enlivened Block entity."
		""
		"Enlivened entities can be captured/duplicated by other mods , providing a renewable source of that block. Note: Does not work if the spawner does not copy NBT."
		""
		"Use a Mob Imprisonment Tool on your new entity and duplicate in the Industrial Foregoing Mob Duplicator."
	]
	quest.56A94DAFCAD45B09.quest_desc: ["Craft a §6Botanist Workbench§r. Each Chipped station opens a catalog of hundreds of cosmetic variants for one family of materials."]
	quest.56A94DAFCAD45B09.quest_subtitle: "Chipped"
	quest.56A94DAFCAD45B09.title: "Chipped Workbench"
	quest.56AEDCDC723C22F6.quest_desc: ["The §6Bedrock Extractor§r mines bedrock to produce rare resources. Needs Duratium, Heisenberg Compensator and Overcharged Crystal."]
	quest.56AEDCDC723C22F6.quest_subtitle: "Oritech"
	quest.56C64C2B2A2EE15F.quest_desc: ["Nine Crystallized Menril Chunks compacted. Storage and an ingredient for the larger devices."]
	quest.56C64C2B2A2EE15F.quest_subtitle: "Integrated Dynamics"
	quest.56CA2BD982503BB0.quest_desc: ["Refill cake with eyes of ender. Requires an advanced crafting table to craft."]
	quest.56CA2BD982503BB0.quest_subtitle: "Ex Deorum"
	quest.56CA2BD982503BB0.title: "Into the End"
	quest.56E6564F39FC9864.quest_desc: ["Craft a §6Dank§r, a portable storage device that holds many stacks of dozens of item types in one compact inventory. Tier §e1§r is modest, but it scales fast."]
	quest.56E6564F39FC9864.quest_subtitle: "Dank Storage"
	quest.56E6564F39FC9864.title: "Pocket Storage"
	quest.56E6CB368A75610E.quest_desc: ["Craft a §6Dank§r, a portable storage device that holds many stacks of dozens of item types in one compact inventory. Tier §e1§r is modest, but it scales fast."]
	quest.56E6CB368A75610E.quest_subtitle: "Dank Storage"
	quest.56E6CB368A75610E.title: "Pocket Storage"
	quest.56E9EC4ECE3113B7.quest_desc: ["The §6Mechanical Piston§r moves an attached contraption in a straight line. Combine with chassis to move groups of blocks."]
	quest.56E9EC4ECE3113B7.quest_subtitle: "Create"
	quest.56F4EB239C973603.quest_desc: ["The §6Modification Station§r installs modules into the Meka-Tool and MekaSuit."]
