	quest.664FCA66D021E5EB.quest_desc: [
		"Years after their original inception, magical botanists have finally found a new material able to harness the powers of aura through new means: the mystical and elusive )Netherite. With it, one can create a most powerful material: Ingots of the Depths. These ingots, as expected, can also be turned into armor and tools."
		""
