	quest.69D590FA274E2B41.quest_desc: [
		"Place the Flux Crafter in-world and right-click to view the GUI. Inside there's a 3x3 crafting grid, similar to a Crafting Table. Place your recipe ingredients into the grid."
		""
		"If the recipe is correct, the Flux Crafter should start to take energy from all (powered) Flux Alternators placed within a 4 block radius. You can tell if they're working if they are emitting particle effects.\"Used to craft components for more complex recipes. Requires at least one flux powered alternator placed near the crafter."
	]
