	quest.6A3BC809F00251A2.quest_desc: ["A powerful sword in it's own right by charging it and using activating it (C) the §6Red Matter Sword§r will consume EMC in exchange for a devastating sweep attack. The area of the attack is controlled by charge level (V, shift+V)."]
