	quest.6D1640B0CC4ADAF6.quest_desc: [
		"Features:"
		""
		"- Multiblock Construction: Build your own Foundry using various blocks like bricks, tanks, drains and windows to create a fully functional smelting setup."
		"- Efficient Smelting: The Foundry smelts ores faster than traditional furnaces, allowing you to process multiple types of ores simultaneously and produce more ingots with less fuel."
		"- Casting: The Foundry features a casting system where you can pour molten metal into casts to create ingots, blocks, or other metal items, adding a new layer of depth to crafting and resource management."
		"- Customizable Design: The size and layout of the Foundry can be customized, with foundry blocks in all 16 colors to match your base."
	]
	quest.6D16777C65BCA017.quest_desc: [
		"Sophisticated backpacks is yet another backpack mod this time with backpacks you can place in world, color in different color combinations, upgrade with more inventory and enhance with many functional upgrades."
		""
		"Can be accessed using a key press (by default B)."
		""
		"Accessories compatibility makes it possible to wear and render the backpack when put in “Back” slot."
		""
		"Each of the tiers adds more storage slots and more upgrade slots."
	]
