	quest.7095B4385D9EB4B1.quest_desc: ["§bVoid Miners§r pull resources straight out of the void, perfect for a skyblock. It all starts with the §6Structure Panel§r, the basic building block of every machine and part."]
	quest.7095B4385D9EB4B1.quest_subtitle: "Void Miners"
	quest.7095B4385D9EB4B1.title: "Structure Panel"
	quest.709A60C9D335B6AF.quest_desc: ["§6Supreme Tier Installer§r. Upgrades a machine or factory to the next tier in place."]
	quest.709A60C9D335B6AF.quest_subtitle: "Extras: Storage"
	quest.709A60C9D335B6AF.title: "Supreme Tier Installer"
	quest.709AE9E272CD7894.quest_desc: ["Upgraded machine frames are crafted using the Dissolution Chamber. See JEI.. Requires Ether Gas, harvested from a wither using a fluid laser."]
	quest.70A8E4AE5CBA60D7.quest_desc: [
		"To use framed blocks:"
		""
		"- Right click the block with almost any solid block to make it look alike."
		"- Right click the block with a fluid container to make it look like the fluid in the container."
		"- Right click the block with Glowstone Dust to make it produce light."
		"- Right click the block with a Framed Hammer to remove the camo."
		"- Right click the block with an empty fluid container to remove a fluid camo."
	]
	quest.70B02D64EC26068F.quest_desc: ["Supply §e250 billion§r FE to a Quest Task Screen."]
	quest.70B02D64EC26068F.quest_subtitle: "Grandmaster"
	quest.70B02D64EC26068F.title: "Infinite Power"
	quest.70B2D74A90740F37.quest_desc: ["§6Magenta Matter§r, matter tier §e4§r. The crafting material behind tier §e4§r collectors, relays, flowers and links."]
	quest.70B2D74A90740F37.quest_subtitle: "Project Expansion: Matter"
	quest.70B2D74A90740F37.title: "Magenta Matter"
	quest.70C9EAA003A86448.quest_desc: ["Made up of the most expensive ingot in the game. Maybe not the best choice for building."]
	quest.70D9A79728CFE5F4.quest_desc: ["More complex crafting ingredients than the prosperity shard, needed to progress in Mystical Agriculture."]
	quest.70D9A79728CFE5F4.title: "Gemstone and Ingot"
	quest.70E2E30BDB0E7AB8.quest_desc: ["Pattern Core for the Assembler Matrix. Holds the patterns the matrix crafts."]
	quest.70E2E30BDB0E7AB8.quest_subtitle: "ExtendedAE"
	quest.70F9784D4674179A.quest_desc: ["§6Cosmic Compressing Factory§r. Processes many items at once. Higher tiers add more slots and speed."]
	quest.70F9784D4674179A.quest_subtitle: "Extras: Factories"
	quest.70F9784D4674179A.title: "Cosmic Compressing Factory"
	quest.7105D5D0A4CAABA2.quest_desc: [
		"The Infusion Altar is the core component of the multi-block Infusion crafting structure. Along with Infusion Pedestals, the altar is mainly used to craft Resource Seeds and Augments. See JEI for uses."
		""
		"To use the Infusion Altar, you must first place it down in the world. Make sure the surrounding area is clear of obstructions. Then, you must place Infusion Pedestals around the altar. The altar will show ghost pedestals in the world, indicating where you must place the pedestals."
		""
		"Once your altar is set up, you can place items on the altar and pedestals by right-clicking on them with an item in hand."
		""
		"To activate the altar you can provide the altar with a Redstone signal (ex. button, lever)."
	]
	quest.710CE2183826CDD3.quest_desc: ["§6Infinite Oxidizing Factory§r. An Extras-only factory type, available in the four highest tiers."]
	quest.710CE2183826CDD3.quest_subtitle: "Extras: Factories"
	quest.710CE2183826CDD3.title: "Infinite Oxidizing Factory"
	quest.711ACC6673BD793D.quest_desc: ["§6Supreme Induction Cell§r. Raises an Induction Matrix's energy capacity."]
	quest.711ACC6673BD793D.quest_subtitle: "Extras: Storage"
	quest.711ACC6673BD793D.title: "Supreme Induction Cell"
	quest.712CDA98B23C2E82.quest_desc: ["§6Ultimate Pressurized Tube§r. Carries gases and chemicals."]
	quest.712CDA98B23C2E82.quest_subtitle: "Extras: Transport"
	quest.712CDA98B23C2E82.title: "Ultimate Pressurized Tube"
	quest.712D46C093C92BA7.title: "Draconic Reactor"
	quest.7139AC799DC225FA.quest_desc: ["Each of the tiers adds more storage slots and more upgrade slots."]
	quest.7143466ED89C678A.quest_desc: ["Gather pearls in bulk. Defeat §e256§r endermen."]
	quest.7143466ED89C678A.quest_subtitle: "Journeyman"
	quest.7143466ED89C678A.title: "Ender Errand"
	quest.714DD2BC87D5A3A8.quest_desc: ["Break infested leaves with a crook to get string!"]
	quest.717D746DE162FC1D.quest_desc: ["Logic Cables form the network that carries variables between parts. Attach parts to their sides with the Wrench."]
	quest.717D746DE162FC1D.quest_subtitle: "Integrated Dynamics"
	quest.718AA0B709847726.quest_desc: ["Craft a §6Gem Case§r and an §6Ender Gem Case§r to store and carry your growing gem collection."]
	quest.718AA0B709847726.quest_subtitle: "Apotheosis"
	quest.718AA0B709847726.title: "Gem Vault"
	quest.71985D320264CC4B.quest_desc: ["How To Change Texture: Inside a crafting window place the block you want to use the texture of for the outside of the drawer in the first slot of the crafting window, on the second slot put the block that will be used for the texture on the inside of the framed drawer, and on the third slot put a framed drawer. You can change the drawer divider texture by adding a block into the 4th slot."]
	quest.71A0C77C78ED5B37.quest_desc: ["Pulls items from containers into the QIO network."]
	quest.71A0C77C78ED5B37.quest_subtitle: "QIO Network"
	quest.71A0C77C78ED5B37.title: "QIO Importer"
	quest.71C5B72891529DDB.quest_desc: ["Special apples that give different buffs! Hold shift while hovering over the apple to see its effects."]
	quest.71DB73648BAE99A0.quest_desc: ["Get a §bGem§r and a §6Sigil of Socketing§r. The sigil adds a socket to gear. Slot the gem in for a permanent bonus."]
	quest.71DB73648BAE99A0.quest_subtitle: "Apotheosis"
	quest.71DB73648BAE99A0.title: "Gems \\& Sockets"
	quest.71E75FEACF764F83.quest_desc: [
		"Together with the ritual, knowledge of Tokens can be gained: Wooden figurines, depicting key emotions - created from trees infused with their respective symbols. These figurines contain a combination of the vast power of aura itself and the power of the emotions they represent. Going forward, these Tokens will be a key construction ingredient."
		""
		"Refer to the Book of Natural Aura (guidebook) for full detailed information on Nature's Aura."
	]
	quest.71E75FEACF764F83.title: "Fear and Sorrow"
	quest.71EF8CFADAE86EDC.quest_desc: ["Summons a Starbuncle. Give it a path and it hauls items between chests for you."]
	quest.71EF8CFADAE86EDC.quest_subtitle: "Ars Nouveau"
	quest.720A26E45CB9D619.quest_desc: ["Wear the §6Monstrous Helm§r, the beast's own skull."]
	quest.720A26E45CB9D619.quest_subtitle: "Cataclysm"
	quest.720A26E45CB9D619.title: "Monstrous Helm"
	quest.721293C985D625C1.quest_subtitle: "Extras: Factories"
	quest.721293C985D625C1.title: "Absolute Crystallizing Factory"
	quest.72353D397FFE788A.quest_desc: ["Made of 10,000 bronze ingots"]
	quest.72595A7B8D302FE6.quest_desc: ["§6Advanced Injecting Factory§r. Processes many items at once. Higher tiers add more slots and speed."]
	quest.72595A7B8D302FE6.quest_subtitle: "Extras: Factories"
	quest.72595A7B8D302FE6.title: "Advanced Injecting Factory"
	quest.725D235C07DB7608.quest_desc: ["Put your essence farm to work. Gather §e2,048§r Inferium Essence."]
